# Selfless Safewright's hexproof half, apart from indestructible: Bot2 casts Lightning Bolt at Bot1's Elvish Mystic on turn 2, and in response Bot1
# flashes in the Safewright (Mox Emerald {G}, Mox Ruby {1}, Mox Pearl {1}, and the Mystic itself tapped to convoke {G}, Memnite {1}),
# choosing Elf. The Mystic has hexproof when the Bolt resolves, so its target is illegal and the Bolt does nothing (CR 608.2b): the Mystic has no
# damage marked. Bot1's Safewright is not the target and is untouched.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Elvish Mystic
Memnite
Selfless Safewright
Forest x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x18

